# Rule Evaluation Process

1. Submit a prompt to the IDE
2. Buffered prompt in BART for later processing
3. BART classifies and keeps relevant entries (if confidence high)
4. Metadata extraction, deduplication, and ChromaDB upsert if kept entry is strong enough
5. RuleEvaluator.evaluate() runs on successfully stored memory, degrading score for 'CONTRADICT' judgment only if topic .mdc already exists
